w Condensed';letter-spacing:1.5px;padding:0 16px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.start-button span{float:right;font-size:19px;line-height:12px}.start-button:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.start-note{display:block;margin-top:12px;color:#828c81;font-size:7px;letter-spacing:1px}.start-footer{position:absolute;left:34px;right:34px;bottom:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:7px;color:#879188;letter-spacing:1.3px}.modal-screen{display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(5,9,8,.79);backdrop-filter:blur(7px);z-index:6}.modal-screen.visible{display:flex}.modal-card{position:relative;width:min(460px,90vw);padding:28px;background:#151d19;border:1px solid #b5c39c55;box-shadow:0 16px 70px #0009}.modal-card h2{font:800 37px 'Barlow Condensed';letter-spacing:1px;margin:9px 0 18px}.close-modal{position:absolute;right:15px;top:12px;background:none;border:0;color:#d9dfcf;font-size:25px}.inventory-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7px}.inventory-item{border:1px solid #bfc9ae30;padding:10px;background:#0d1411;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.inventory-item span{font-size:20px}.inventory-item b{font:600 14px 'Barlow Condensed';display:block}.inventory-item small{font-size:8px;color:#9ca69a}.inventory-item button{margin-left:auto;background:none;border:1px solid #9cac8733;color:#d1d9c2;padding:5px 7px;font:8px 'DM Mono'}.inventory-tip{font-size:8px;color:#9da69c;margin-top:13px}.pause-card{text-align:center}.pause-card .eyebrow{justify-content:center}.pause-card p{font-size:11px;color:#aeb7a9;margin:-5px 0 22px}.pause-card .start-button{text-align:center}.plain-button{display:block;margin:13px auto 0;border:0;background:none;color:#a7b09f;font:9px 'DM Mono';letter-spacing:1px;padding:10px}.mobile-controls{display:none}.stick{position:absolute;left:5vw;bottom:10vh;width:112px;height:112px;touch-action:none}.stick-base{position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid #dae2c655;background:#17201b7a;dis